{"step_index":1643,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T19:54:34Z","input_tokens":2929,"cache_read_tokens":166698,"output_tokens":1148,"thinking":"Intra-state transactions require matching GSTIN prefixes; if they match, IGST must be zero. Confirmed that CGST and SGST must be equal for intra-state. Inter-state transactions require a non-zero IGST, and CGST and SGST should both be zero. These conditions are now implemented.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"edit_file","args":{"Path":"/Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it/utils/auditEngine.js","Replacement":"  // Tax Calculations with strict float precision\n  let cgst = round2(Number(invoice.cgst) || 0);\n  let sgst = round2(Number(invoice.sgst) || 0);\n  let igst = round2(Number(invoice.igst) || 0);\n\n  // INTRA-STATE vs INTER-STATE AUTO-DETERMINATION:\n  // Compare the first 2 digits of the Supplier GSTIN (06) and Buyer GSTIN (06)\n  const supplierGstin = (invoice.gstin || \"\").trim().toUpperCase();\n  const buyerGstin = (invoice.buyer_gstin || \"06CORPP2712A1Z1\").trim().toUpperCase();\n  const supplierState = supplierGstin ? supplierGstin.slice(0, 2) : \"06\";\n  const buyerState = buyerGstin ? buyerGstin.slice(0, 2) : \"06\";\n  const isIntraState = supplierState === buyerState;\n\n  if (isIntraState) {\n    // Intra-State: IGST must strictly be 0\n    if (igst > 0) {\n      issues.push({\n        type: \"WARNING\",\n        field: \"igst\",\n        title: \"Invalid IGST on Intra-State Bill\",\n        description: `Both Supplier (${supplierState}) and Buyer (${buyerState}) are in the same state. Intra-state supply requires IGST to be ₹0.00 and uses CGST + SGST.`\n      });\n    }\n    // CGST and SGST equality check\n    if (cgst > 0 || sgst > 0) {\n      if (Math.abs(cgst - sgst) > 1.00) {\n        issues.push({\n          type: \"WARNING\",\n          field: \"gst_split\",\n          title: \"CGST and SGST Mismatch\",\n          description: `Intra-state GST requires CGST (${formatRupees(cgst)}) to equal SGST (${formatRupees(sgst)}).`\n        });\n      }\n    }\n  } else {\n    // Inter-State: CGST and SGST must be 0, IGST applies\n    if (cgst > 0 || sgst > 0) {\n      issues.push({\n        type: \"WARNING\",\n        field: \"gst_split\",\n        title: \"CGST/SGST on Inter-State Bill\",\n        description: `Supplier state (${supplierState}) and Buyer state (${buyerState}) differ. Inter-state supply requires CGST and SGST to be ₹0.00, and IGST (${formatRupees(igst)}) to apply.`\n      });\n    }\n  }\n\n  const totalTax = round2(cgst + sgst + igst);","Target":"  // Tax Calculations with strict float precision\n  const cgst = round2(Number(invoice.cgst) || 0);\n  const sgst = round2(Number(invoice.sgst) || 0);\n  const igst = round2(Number(invoice.igst) || 0);\n  const totalTax = round2(cgst + sgst + igst);\n\n  // GST Split check\n  if (cgst > 0 || sgst > 0) {\n    if (Math.abs(cgst - sgst) > 1.00) {\n      issues.push({\n        type: \"WARNING\",\n        field: \"gst_split\",\n        title: \"CGST and SGST Mismatch\",\n        description: `Intra-state GST requires CGST (${formatRupees(cgst)}) to equal SGST (${formatRupees(sgst)}).`\n      });\n    }\n  }"}}]}
