{"step_index":1693,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-02T19:56:55Z","input_tokens":2404,"cache_read_tokens":186518,"output_tokens":2276,"thinking":"The `handleUpdateHeader` function in `app.js` is now under examination to determine if it handles updates to the `buyer_gstin` field. It appears the function updates invoice header fields based on the input 'field' and 'value'. The code logic suggests that any field can be updated, therefore `buyer_gstin` should be updatable.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"cd /Users/pranit405/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/audit-it && ./venv/bin/python3 -c '\nimport re\nfrom utils.clean_items import sanitize_and_clean_invoice\n\n# 1. Test Regex: Ensure item quantity and wattage are NEVER captured as tax\ncgst_pat = re.compile(r\"(?:CGST|Central GST)[\\s@%]*([0-9\\.]+)?%?[\\s:]*[₹\\s]*([0-9,]+(?:\\.[0-9]{2})?)\", re.I)\nsgst_pat = re.compile(r\"(?:SGST|State GST)[\\s@%]*([0-9\\.]+)?%?[\\s:]*[₹\\s]*([0-9,]+(?:\\.[0-9]{2})?)\", re.I)\nigst_pat = re.compile(r\"(?:IGST|Integrated GST)[\\s@%]*([0-9\\.]+)?%?[\\s:]*[₹\\s]*([0-9,]+(?:\\.[0-9]{2})?)\", re.I)\n\nassert cgst_pat.search(\"LED Tube Light 20W\") is None, \"20W must not match CGST!\"\nassert cgst_pat.search(\"Modular Switch Pack of 20\") is None, \"Pack of 20 must not match CGST!\"\nassert sgst_pat.search(\"LED Batten 20W Cool Day\") is None, \"20W must not match SGST!\"\nassert igst_pat.search(\"20W LED Bulb B22\") is None, \"20W must not match IGST!\"\n\n# Valid tax lines MUST match\nm_cgst = cgst_pat.search(\"CGST @ 9%: ₹990.00\")\nassert m_cgst is not None and m_cgst.group(2) == \"990.00\"\nm_sgst = sgst_pat.search(\"SGST @ 9%: 990.00\")\nassert m_sgst is not None and m_sgst.group(2) == \"990.00\"\nm_igst = igst_pat.search(\"Integrated GST @ 18%: 1,980.00\")\nassert m_igst is not None and m_igst.group(2) == \"1,980.00\"\nprint(\"✓ Requirement 1 (Regex & Wattage/Quantity Exclusion) PASSED!\")\n\n# 2. Test Intra-State Auto-Determination:\n# Supplier 06 (Haryana) vs Buyer 06 (Haryana), Subtotal 11,000, 18% tax\nintra_data = {\n    \"gstin\": \"06AABCS1429B1Z2\",\n    \"buyer_gstin\": \"06CORPP2712A1Z1\",\n    \"items\": [\n        {\"description\": \"Heavy Industrial Cable\", \"quantity\": 11, \"unit_rate\": 1000.0, \"total_amount\": 11000.0}\n    ],\n    \"subtotal\": 11000.0,\n    \"cgst\": 0.0,\n    \"sgst\": 0.0,\n    \"igst\": 0.0,\n    \"declared_total\": 12980.0\n}\nres_intra = sanitize_and_clean_invoice(intra_data)\nassert res_intra[\"igst\"] == 0.0, f\"Expected IGST 0.0 for intra-state, got {res_intra['igst']}\"\nassert res_intra[\"cgst\"] == 990.0, f\"Expected CGST 990.0 for intra-state, got {res_intra['cgst']}\"\nassert res_intra[\"sgst\"] == 990.0, f\"Expected SGST 990.0 for intra-state, got {res_intra['sgst']}\"\nprint(\"✓ Requirement 2a (Intra-State 06 vs 06 -> CGST 990, SGST 990, IGST 0) PASSED!\")\n\n# 3. Test Inter-State Auto-Determination:\n# Supplier 07 (Delhi) vs Buyer 06 (Haryana), Subtotal 11,000, 18% tax\ninter_data = {\n    \"gstin\": \"07AAECM4821F1ZX\",\n    \"buyer_gstin\": \"06CORPP2712A1Z1\",\n    \"items\": [\n        {\"description\": \"Heavy Industrial Cable\", \"quantity\": 11, \"unit_rate\": 1000.0, \"total_amount\": 11000.0}\n    ],\n    \"subtotal\": 11000.0,\n    \"cgst\": 0.0,\n    \"sgst\": 0.0,\n    \"igst\": 0.0,\n    \"declared_total\": 12980.0\n}\nres_inter = sanitize_and_clean_invoice(inter_data)\nassert res_inter[\"cgst\"] == 0.0, f\"Expected CGST 0.0 for inter-state, got {res_inter['cgst']}\"\nassert res_inter[\"sgst\"] == 0.0, f\"Expected SGST 0.0 for inter-state, got {res_inter['sgst']}\"\nassert res_inter[\"igst\"] == 1980.0, f\"Expected IGST 1980.0 for inter-state, got {res_inter['igst']}\"\nprint(\"✓ Requirement 2b (Inter-State 07 vs 06 -> CGST 0, SGST 0, IGST 1980) PASSED!\")\n\n# 4. Test FastAPI endpoint /api/process-invoice\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient\nfrom server import app\nclient = TestClient(app)\n\nresp = client.post(\"/api/process-invoice\", json=intra_data)\nassert resp.status_code == 200\nout = resp.json()[\"extracted_data\"]\nassert out[\"cgst\"] == 990.0\nassert out[\"sgst\"] == 990.0\nassert out[\"igst\"] == 0.0\nassert out[\"declared_total\"] == 12980.0\nprint(\"✓ Requirement 3 (FastAPI & Server Endpoint Sync) PASSED!\")\n\nprint(\"\\n🎉 ALL GST TAX EXTRACTION & VERIFICATION TESTS PASSED SUCCESSFULLY!\")\n'","WaitMsBeforeAsync":8000,"toolSummary":"Run test script for GST tax extraction and verification"}}]}
